#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:2
msgid "Step 1: Make a Purchase"
msgstr "Steg 1: Gör ett köp"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:5
msgid "First, a purchase is made through a payment processor."
msgstr "Först görs ett köp via en betalningsprocessor."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:7
msgid "Step 2: Email Confirmation"
msgstr "Steg 2: E-postbekräftelse"

#. Translators: Please preserve spacing and new lines
#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:11
msgid ""
"Once the payment processor confirms the payment, we will send a confirmation "
"email to you. This email will look like the following:\n"
"\n"
"    Thanks for ordering from us. This email confirms your order of <your "
"product>.\n"
"\n"
"    Your Order ID is <order ID> and your payment has now cleared. A receipt "
"has been emailed to you separately.\n"
"\n"
"    You can download your digital products from <URL>\n"
"\n"
"The URL is a unique secret that you can use to access your downloads. Please "
"save this email for future reference. Your Order ID is important."
msgstr ""
"När betalningsprocessen bekräftar betalningen skickar vi en bekräftelse till "
"dig via e-post. Detta e-postmeddelande kommer att se ut som följande:\n"
"\n"
"Tack för beställning från oss. Detta e-postmeddelande bekräftar din "
"beställning av <din produkt>.\n"
"\n"
"Ditt order-ID är <order-ID> och din betalning har nu rensats. Ett kvitto har "
"skickats till dig separat via e-post.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan ladda ner dina digitala produkter ifrån <URL>\n"
"\n"
"URL:en är en unik hemlighet som du kan använda för att komma åt dina "
"nedladdningar. Spara detta e-postmeddelande för framtida referens. Ditt "
"order-ID är viktigt."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:21
msgid "Step 3: Download Your Products"
msgstr "Steg 3: Ladda ner dina produkter"

#. Translators: Please preserve spacing and new lines
#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:25
msgid ""
"After visiting the URL above, you will see a list of products you can "
"download. Clicking *Download* will start downloading the requested file.\n"
"\n"
"You are expected to save your downloads locally."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha besökt webbadressen ovan ser du en lista över produkter du kan "
"ladda ner. Genom att klicka på * Ladda ner * börjar den begärda filen laddas "
"ner.\n"
"\n"
"Du förväntas spara dina nedladdningar lokalt."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:29
msgid "Step 4: Install"
msgstr "Steg 4: Installera"

#. Translators: Please preserve spacing and new lines
#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:33
msgid ""
"On Windows and Mac, you can simply double click the installers and follow "
"the directions on the screen. This will install Zrythm on your system, "
"optionally creating a shortcut.\n"
"\n"
"On GNU/Linux, you can follow the instructions [here](https://appimage.org/) "
"if you use the AppImage.\n"
"\n"
"If you want to use the universal GNU/Linux installer (recommended), use the "
"`install.sh` script that comes with the zip file, then follow the directions "
"on the console:\n"
"\n"
"    ./install.sh\n"
"\n"
"To use the Flatpak version, install the flatpak ref file with:\n"
"\n"
"    flatpak install <path to .flatpakref file>\n"
msgstr ""
"I Windows och macOS kan du dubbelklicka på installationsprogrammen och följa "
"anvisningarna på skärmen. Då installeras Zrythm på systemet och en genväg "
"kan skapas.\n"
"\n"
"I GNU/Linux kan du följa anvisningarna [här](https://appimage.org/) om du "
"använder AppImage.\n"
"\n"
"Om du vill använda det universella installationsprogrammet för GNU/Linux "
"(rekommenderas) använder du skriptet `install.sh` som följer med zip-filen "
"och följer sedan anvisningarna i konsolen:\n"
"\n"
"    ./install.sh\n"
"\n"
"För att använda Flatpak-versionen installerar du Flatpak-referensfilen med:\n"
"\n"
"    flatpak install <sökväg till .flatpakref-fil>\n"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:46
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Klart"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:49
msgid ""
"\n"
"These are all the steps involved in making an order and installing Zrythm. "
"If you require further assistance, please have a look at the [Getting "
"Started](https://manual.zrythm.org/en/getting-started/intro.html) section in "
"the user manual."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dessa är alla steg som är inblandade i att göra en beställning och "
"installera Zrythm. Om du behöver ytterligare hjälp, vänligen titta på [Kom "
"Igång] (https://manual.zrythm.org/en/getting-started/intro.html) sektionen i "
"användarhandboken."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:52
msgid "Installer/Order Issues"
msgstr "Problem med installation eller order"

#. Translators: Please do not translate the email address
#: accounts/templates/accounts/order-flow.md:56
msgid ""
"\n"
"If the installer fails to install or there is an issue with your order, or "
"to request a refund, please email `orders at zrythm.org`.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Om installationsprogrammet inte fungerar, om det uppstår problem med din "
"order eller om du vill begära återbetalning, skicka e-post till `orders at "
"zrythm.org`.\n"

